### 7. DSP Chain View & Allow Mask (экран)

**Порядок цепочки (жёсткий, для отображения):**  
`Input → DC/Subsonic → PEQ20 → Tone → Loudness → AETHER → BassMono → Psychobass → Night → BassTame → Anti-Ad → Room-Delay → Headroom → Volume/Mute → Look-ahead Limiter → Output`

**Экран Preset Detail / Chain View (схематично):**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Music: Wide                          [Apply] [Edit] [A/B]   │
│ «AETHER WIDE, широкая сцена, бас защищён»                   │
│ Tags: MUSIC  WIDE                                           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ Chain:                                                      │
│ DC → Sub → [PEQ] → Tone → Loud → [AETHER WIDE] → … → Limiter│
│                                                             │
│  [PEQ20] ON   (3 free slots used)     ← OK = edit          │
│  [Tone]  ON   Bass +1.5  Treble +0.5                       │
│  [AETHER] WIDE  Width 1.35  Decor 40%                      │
│  [Night] OFF          [+] Add (allowed)                    │
│  [BassTame] OFF       [+] Add                              │
│  [Anti-Ad] OFF        (not allowed in this preset)         │
